-- a value: a closure, a number, a reference to a held wire, a blocked term (a free variable, an
-- application waiting on a blocked function, an increment waiting on a blocked number, a variable
-- introduced by quotation, numbered by the depth it was introduced at), or a quoted body: a normal
-- form as data
data NkVal = nkv-lam (b : NkTm) (e : NkEnv) | nkv-num (m : Word) | nkv-ref (w : Word) | nkv-var (x : Word) | nkv-napp (f : Word) (a : Word) | nkv-ninc (a : Word) | nkv-lvl (l : Word) | nkv-q (t : NkTm)
